// handleGetWechatChannelsLiveRoomRequest handles get-wechat-channels-live-room operation.
//
// A Channels live by its live ID (the id wechat_channels.live.users.get answers with): whether it is
// still on, start time, likes, the host and the cover, and once it has ended, how many people watched
